# codex_review writes a session sidecar next to its output file. Under .orchestra/ the
# repository .gitignore negation (!.orchestra/**) beats $GIT_DIR/info/exclude, so the sidecar
# would dirty the tree and block merge / mode="implementation" reviews (see CLAUDE.md, #466).
# A deeper .gitignore wins over a shallower one, which is why this file works.
codex_sessions.json
